---
// /locations has no page of its own; send it to the one page below it rather than a 404.
// Permanent, but kept by a browser for a day only (a bare 301 is kept for ever): if this ever becomes a page of its
// own, returning visitors see it the next day, not never (2026-10-29).
return new Response(null, { status: 301, headers: { Location: '/locations/zainab-aziza', 'Cache-Control': 'public, max-age=86400' } });
---
